title: "FairMedFM: Fairness Benchmarking for Medical Imaging Foundation Models"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: "Fairness metrics for any binary classification or segmentation model (subgroup AUC, accuracy, calibration and Dice gaps, equal opportunity, equalized odds and equity-scaled Dice), and a fairness benchmark of medical imaging foundation models."
